OL,3,GNEWSATrain services disrupted due to
OL,4,Asecurity alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrain services have resumed following a
OL,7,Fsecurity alert in Lurgan, County
OL,8,FArmagh.
OL,10,FTranslink advised passengers to allow
OL,11,Ffor delays and disruption to services
OL,12,Fon this line, which was closed between
OL,13,FBelfast and Portadown with replacement
OL,14,Fbus services operating.
OL,16,FThe 12:00 BST Belfast Grand Central
OL,17,FStation to Dublin Connolly will not
OL,18,Foperate following the incident.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
